sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Helm Client / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant OLM as OLM<br/>(OpenShift only)
    participant CatalogSrc as CatalogSource<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PostHook1 as post-install-crs Job<br/>(Hook Weight 1)
    participant PostHook2 as post-create-gateway Job<br/>(Hook Weight 2)
    participant PostHook3 as post-create-maas-gateway Job<br/>(Hook Weight 3)
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager<br/>CA Secret
    participant Operator as RHAI Operator<br/>Deployment

    rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
        Note over User,Operator: Flow 1: xKS Helm Install (AWS/Azure/CoreWeave)
        User->>K8sAPI: helm install rhai<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
        K8sAPI-->>User: CRDs, RBAC, Operator Deployment created

        Note over PostHook1: Hook Weight 1
        PostHook1->>K8sAPI: Create KubernetesEngine CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        PostHook1->>K8sAPI: Create Platform CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        PostHook1->>K8sAPI: Create Kserve/AIGateway CRs<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

        Note over PostHook2: Hook Weight 2
        PostHook2->>CertMgr: Read CA certificate<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        CertMgr-->>PostHook2: CA bundle
        PostHook2->>K8sAPI: Create inference-gateway Gateway CR<br/>+ TLS Certificate + CA ConfigMap
        K8sAPI-->>PostHook2: Gateway created

        Note over PostHook3: Hook Weight 3
        PostHook3->>CertMgr: Read CA certificate<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        CertMgr-->>PostHook3: CA bundle
        PostHook3->>K8sAPI: Create maas-default-gateway Gateway CR<br/>+ TLS Certificate + Authorino CA trust
        K8sAPI-->>PostHook3: MaaS Gateway created

        Operator->>K8sAPI: Watch Platform, Kserve, KE CRs<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>Operator: Reconcile events
    end

    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)
        Note over User,Operator: Flow 2: OpenShift Helm Install (OLM)
        User->>K8sAPI: helm install rhai-openshift<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
        K8sAPI->>OLM: Subscription CR created
        OLM->>CatalogSrc: Resolve operator bundle<br/>HTTPS TLS1.2+
        CatalogSrc-->>OLM: Bundle metadata
        OLM->>K8sAPI: Install operator Deployment<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        User->>K8sAPI: DataScienceCluster CR<br/>+ DSCInitialization CR
        K8sAPI-->>User: CRs created with profile config
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 200)
        Note over User,Operator: Flow 3: Kustomize GitOps Deploy
        User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply -k / ArgoCD sync<br/>Auth: kubeconfig / ArgoCD SA
        K8sAPI->>OLM: Subscription CRs (12+ operators)
        User->>K8sAPI: Configuration CRs<br/>(Kuadrant, Kueue, LWS, JobSet, etc.)
        K8sAPI-->>User: All operators and configs applied
    end
